{
  "id": "duration-weighted-rainfall",
  "title": "Integrate irregular precipitation intervals",
  "brief": "irregular.zarr has precipitation rates and explicit time_bounds. Each rate is constant over its half-open [start,end) interval; intervals have unequal durations. Compute complete weekly totals for Jan 1\u20138 and Jan 8\u201315, weighting rates by covered duration. Return dates (week starts), totals_mm, and units='mm'.",
  "challenge": "An arithmetic mean of records is wrong when each record represents a different number of days.",
